# General env. variables for justfile tooling.

# The terraform environment to use for all `tofu` commands.
# TF_ENV=dev

# The wireguard user to use, which selects your special IP to connect
# to the wireguard VPN.
# WIREGUARD_USER="<github-username>"
# WIREGUARD_PRIVATE_KEY_FILE="$HOME/.config/wireguard/sdsc-ordes-cloud-infra.age"

# The SOPS age key file to decrypt secrets. sops reads it natively and prompts
# for the passphrase if the file is passphrase-encrypted (as produced by
# `just sops::generate-key`). A plaintext age key file works too but is not recommended.
SOPS_AGE_KEY_FILE="$HOME/.config/sops/sdsc-ordes-cloud-infra.agekey.age"
